          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem circle_identity (X N : ℕ) (a b c : ℕ → ℂ) :\n    ∫ α in (0:ℝ)..1, expSum X a α * expSum X b α * expSum X c α * e (-(N * α)) =\n      ∑ n₁ ∈ range (X + 1), ∑ n₂ ∈ range (X + 1), ∑ n₃ ∈ range (X + 1),\n        if n₁ + n₂ + n₃ = N then a n₁ * b n₂ * c n₃ else 0 := by",
            "line": 82,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.circle_identity",
            "lines": [
              80,
              113
            ],
            "conclusion": "For finite exponential sums `S_a,S_b,S_c` (`expSum`), `∫_0^1 S_a S_b S_c e(-Nα) dα = Σ_{n₁+n₂+n₃=N} a(n₁)b(n₂)c(n₃)`: the triple additive convolution evaluated at `N`."
          },
